          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There was only 0.1%\nalleged adulteration which may be due to weather condition and passage of time after grinding of the same and in such cases under Sections 51 and 52 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 penalty has been provided."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e3ae66cd6717446a8217d1a40c4a1d15_40",
